$G_0$, with error 0.070146. The ensemble scores 0.070065, improving only 0.000081
or 0.12\%, with mean initial weight 0.980. This difference is the only one below
0.05 among 24 corrected scaling contrasts, with interval $[0.000039,0.000124]$
and adjusted $p=0.0469$. It is practically small and conditional on fixed Monte
Carlo streams, without uncertainty over alternative generation seeds.

